[[Circular Economy]] + [[Design]]? Could also be referred to as [[Cradle to Cradle]] design

A type of [[Sustainable Design]] -> Design that pushes PAST sustainability into the regenerative, or restorative. Design whose outputs become inputs for next processes. Design where [[Waste = Food]] 

